    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d186">

                <pb facs="0357" n="225" xml:id="pg225"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">840.4016 DP/7–545</note>
                <head>No. 186 <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Czechoslovakia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Klieforth</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/> No. 42</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Praha</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-07-05">July 5, 1945</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">Subject: Czechoslovakia’s desire to have application for
                    transfer of minorities placed on agenda for forthcoming meeting of Big
                    Three.</p>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to my telegram No. 59 of
                    July 4, 1945,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d186-f1"/> 1 have the honor to transmit
                    herewith a copy of the Foreign Office note in English expressing the desire of
                    the President<anchor n="2" xml:id="d186-f2"/> and Government of Czechoslovakia
                    to have the application for the transfer of the minorities placed on the agenda
                    at the forthcoming meeting of President Truman, Prime Minister Churchill and Marshal
                        Stalin.</p>
                <p>Respectfully yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        A W <hi rendition="#small-caps">Klieforth</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d186-f1" n="1" xml:id="d186-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed. This telegram transmitted a telegraphic text of the enclosure to the
                    despatch here printed. For the text of the enclosure, see <ref target="#d439"
                        >document No. 439</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d186-f2" n="2" xml:id="d186-f2-content">
                <p>
                    Edvard Beneš.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
